tton></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure is taken only on ordinals contained in the explicitly sourced universe of the domain structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3$, $\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$, and $\\mathrm{Univ}$ is the structure-universe operator (see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]], [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3$, $\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$, and $\\mathrm{Univ}$ is the structure-universe operator (see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]], [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved